Package: kartdata
Title: Client for Norwegian Mapping Authority Topographic Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Håkon", "Malmedal", , "hmalmedal@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Discover and download topographic N-series data directly from
    Geonorge using official ATOM feeds. Cache original archives locally and
    read individual spatial layers with 'sf'. No map data are distributed.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: sf, httr2, xml2
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.2.0), roxygen2, zip
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/hmalmedal/kartdata, https://hmalmedal.github.io/kartdata/
BugReports: https://github.com/hmalmedal/kartdata/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
